쎄쿁??鍮?*/\\r\\n  count: number\\r\\n  /** ???繞섎뱪寃?醫귣퉩?猷붽쾸?怨κ괭??二???쐻?怨κ데????リ쿁俑앸씤??*/\\r\\n  slotStart: number\\r\\n  /** ?봔??嚥≪뮇類?x?癒?퐣 域밸챶?곫묾???뽰삂??롫뮉 ?袁⑺뒄 (mm) */\\r\\n  fromMm: number\\r\\n  /** 3D??域밸챶???疫뀀챷??(mm) */\\r\\n  drawnMm: number\\r\\n  /** 力녹늸???怨쀬뿯 ?袁⑹벥 庸?怡?猷붽괵 (mm) */\\r\\n  designMm: number\\r\\n  /** ???袁⑺뒄??疫뀀챷?좂몴??類λ립 ????(?紐꾨? 筌왖?癒?벥 畑댁떓?) */\\r\\n  rules: RuleHit[]\\r\\n  basis: string\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\ninterface CutoffRow {\\r\\n  role: '鼇앸봺???ｊ맙??沅?類잛땠' | '鼇앸뿧???ｊ맙??沅?類잛땠'\\r\\n  /** 1????洹숆굴??쎄쿁??鍮?*/\\r\\n  count: number\\r\\n  at: '櫻?源? | '?띕뿧??諛ㅺ땟?? | '麗멸퇍??諛ㅺ땟?? | '?띕뿧?? | '麗멸퇍?? | '鼇???\\r\\n  slotStart: number\\r\\n  y: number\\r\\n  bendDirection: '鼇? | '鼇?\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction cutoffPositions(\\r\\n  input: GirderRebarInput,\\r\\n  pack: RulePack,\\r\\n  row: CutoffRow,\\r\\n): CutoffPosition[] {\\r\\n  const { run, section } = input\\r\\n  const cutoffMm = section.main.cutoffFromSupportFaceMm\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (cutoffMm <= 0) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍????癒れ낌',\\r\\n      `??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??must be positive when 櫻?源??㏓쫷勇?寃??鍮??り괵?? ` +\\r\\n        `${run.ownerId} (${row.role} ${row.count}??`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  // 鼇앪넀???ｊ덩辱됰ı寃??ｊ텠?猿곴퉱??껉묄癲ル뿣嫄?酉고룒??쎈퉻?類쏄쾸???怨κ국????寃밴쿂鼇????ｊ탾櫻뗫뿣寃??\\n  // ?袁좉데?蹂앷쾹??ｊ쾼??승?ν맍??????몟?寃밴괏?類쏄콨??꿸쾹?袁좉콨?琯???꾪맚??㏓땱??곸낌??녾쾼?袁졖?\\n  const tooShort = run.spans.find(({ clear }) => clear <= 2 * cutoffMm)\\r\\n  if (tooShort) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍????癒れ낌',\\r\\n      `??얩?猷붽괵 must exceed 2???ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍?? ${run.ownerId} ` +\\r\\n        `(??얩?${tooShort.clear} ??2??{cutoffMm})`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (row.at === '鼇???) {\\r\\n    return run.members.map((member, index) => {\\r\\n      const { clear } = run.spans[index]\\r\\n      const designMm = clear - 2 * cutoffMm\\r\\n\\r\\n      return {\\r\\n        memberId: member.id,\\r\\n        count: row.count,\\r\\n        slotStart: row.slotStart,\\r\\n        fromMm: cutoffMm,\\r\\n        drawnMm: designMm,\\r\\n        designMm,\\r\\n        rules: [],\\r\\n        basis:\\r\\n          `??얩?猷붽괵 ${clear} ????ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??${cutoffMm} ?? 塋?${designMm}` +\\r\\n          `塋딅뛻瑜??닿쿁??沅??λ렭??⑸듋?????뉕데??寃롳Ⅴ????寃?袁ы렫`,\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const endInput = {\\r\\n    barSize: section.main.size,\\r\\n    fc: section.fc,\\r\\n    grade: section.grade,\\r\\n    bendDirection: row.bendDirection,\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  const startSpan = run.spans[0]\\r\\n  const endSpan = run.spans[run.spans.length - 1]\\r\\n  const start = resolveGirderEnd(\\r\\n    {\\r\\n      ...endInput,\\r\\n      supportLengthMm: startSpan.startSupportLengthAlongAxisMm,\\r\\n      supportCover: startSpan.startSupportCover,\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    pack,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  const end = resolveGirderEnd(\\r\\n    {\\r\\n      ...endInput,\\r\\n      supportLengthMm: endSpan.endSupportLengthAlongAxisMm,\\r\\n      supportCover: endSpan.endSupportCover,\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    pack,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (row.at === '?띕뿧?? || row.at === '麗멸퇍??) {\\r\\n    if (run.spans.length !== 1) {\\r\\n      throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n        '??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍????癒れ낌',\\r\\n        `勇싲쉥????욍궚??ｊ???덇쿁??꿸쿁??沅??μ르?怨κ덩??ｊ쾼?? ${run.ownerId}`,\\r\\n      )\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    const span = run.spans[0]\\r\\n    const detail = row.at === '?띕뿧?? ? start : end\\r\\n    const drawnMm = span.clear - cutoffMm\\r\\n    const label = row.at === '?띕뿧?? ? '?띕뿧???沅? : '麗멸퇍???沅?\\r\\n\\r\\n    return [\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        memberId: run.ownerId,\\r\\n        count: row.count,\\r\\n        slotStart: row.slotStart,\\r\\n        fromMm: row.at === '?띕뿧?? ? 0 : cutoffMm,\\r\\n        drawnMm,\\r\\n        designMm: drawnMm + detail.lengthMm,\\r\\n        rules: detail.usedRules,\\r\\n        basis:\\r\\n          `${endFormula(label, detail)} 塋???얩?猷붽괵 ${span.clear} ??` +\\r\\n          `??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??${cutoffMm} 塋?${drawnMm} 塋?${detail.lengthMm} 塋?` +\\r\\n          `${drawnMm + detail.lengthMm}`,\\r\\n      },\\r\\n    ]\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (row.at === '?띕뿧??諛ㅺ땟?? || row.at === '麗멸퇍??諛ㅺ땟??) {\\r\\n    const detail = row.at === '?띕뿧??諛ㅺ땟?? ? start : end\\r\\n    const label = row.at === '?띕뿧??諛ㅺ땟?? ? '?띕뿧???沅? : '麗멸퇍???沅?\\r\\n\\r\\n    return [\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        memberId: run.ownerId,\\r\\n        count: row.count,\\r\\n        slotStart: row.slotStart,\\r\\n        fromMm:\\r\\n          row.at === '?띕뿧??諛ㅺ땟?? ? 0 : run.coreLengthMm - cutoffMm,\\r\\n        drawnMm: cutoffMm,\\r\\n        designMm: detail.lengthMm + cutoffMm,\\r\\n        rules: detail.usedRules,\\r\\n        basis:\\r\\n          `${endFormula(label, detail)} 塋???ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??${cutoffMm} 塋?` +\\r\\n          `${detail.lengthMm + cutoffMm}`,\\r\\n      },\\r\\n    ]\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  // ?띕뿧???ы깯櫻?援??꿸쾸??닿괩??껉콢 ??鼇앪넀???痢?????┴??낃쾼??㏃쓢埇쎈‥??洹쏅┴??됰뻤?띠λ땽??ｊ쾼??승?\\n  // 1?뤿슔寃??녾쿀??녾쾹??꿸쾽??ｊ굄庸뉖뛾痢??ν떊鵝?븡瑜?寃밴쾼?袁졖洹↔괵??寃숅펶?怡?猷붽괵?洹↔괵??닿쿁??⑸떔?뤿슔寃??껉데??\\n  const outer = (\\r\\n    detail: GirderEndDetail,\\r\\n    fromMm: number,\\r\\n  ): CutoffPosition => ({\\r\\n    memberId: run.ownerId,\\r\\n    count: row.count,\\r\\n    slotStart: row.slotStart,\\r\\n    fromMm,\\r\\n    drawnMm: cutoffMm,\\r\\n    designMm: detail.lengthMm + cutoffMm,\\r\\n    rules: detail.usedRules,\\r\\n    basis:\\r\\n      `${endFormula('勇싲쉘寃??沅?, detail)} 塋???ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??${cutoffMm} 塋?` +\\r\\n      `${detail.lengthMm + cutoffMm}`,\\r\\n  })\\r\\n  // 鼇?堉??沅????κ괼癲ル뿣寃??ｊ굄?琉브???κ굉????畑댁떓???寃??ｊ교?怨???節껉쿁?諛ㅺ튃??덇꺅\\r\\n  // ??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??寃?蹂앷교??댁꽢??덇데??\\n  const interior = run.spans.slice(0, -1).map((_span, index): CutoffPosition => {\\r\\n    const supportStartMm = run.memberOffsetsMm[index] + run.spans[index].clear\\r\\n    const supportMm = run.memberOffsetsMm[index + 1] - supportStartMm\\r\\n    const designMm = 2 * cutoffMm + supportMm\\r\\n\\r\\n    return {\\r\\n      memberId: run.ownerId,\\r\\n      count: row.count,\\r\\n      slotStart: row.slotStart,\\r\\n      fromMm: supportStartMm - cutoffMm,\\r\\n      drawnMm: designMm,\\r\\n      designMm,\\r\\n      rules: [],\\r\\n      basis:\\r\\n        `??ｊ맙??沅?類쒗맍??${cutoffMm} ?? 塋?鼇?堉?湲깃굘??${supportMm} 塋?${designMm}` +\\r\\n        `塋딅뛻由?蹂좊뎠?諛ㅺ뎌??κ굉??寃롳Ⅴ????寃?袁ы렫`,\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  return [\\r\\n    outer(start, 0),\\r\\n    ...interior,\\r\\n    outer(end, run.coreLengthMm - cutoffMm),\\r\\n  ]\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction generateCutoff(\\r\\n  input: GirderRebarInput,\\r\\n  pack: RulePack,\\r\\n  coverRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  fabricationCoverAdditionRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  fabricationCoverMm: number,\\r\\n  rows: CutoffRow[],\\r\\n): Rebar[] {\\r\\n  const { section } = input\\r\\n  const firstRow = rows[0]\\r\\n  if (firstRow === undefined) return []\\r\\n  const lapRule = lookupRule(pack, 'lap.L1', {\\r\\n    fc: section.fc,\\r\\n    grade: section.grade,\\r\\n    hook: false,\\r\\n  })\\r\\n  const lapLengthMm = millimetres(lapRule, barDiameter(section.main.size))\\r\\n  // ??녾쿀??⑸쑘??횧庸뉖뜂鍮?類쏄쾹?琉밸돕?猷붽괵??瑜?諛ㅺ굵 ??癲⑤씤痢?酉명떖 ??룸뻤??Ｂ?⑹ジ??댟怨⑹댇??걔怨?癲딅틹異?r\\n  // ?遺듦쾹??Ｂ?꿸쾹畑댁떏援??ｊ쿁???怨?癲?庸?怡?猷붽괵)??㏓즰?節껉굴?議쇨괩???쿂?곷뀍援??㏃댇??곌탾?猿곴콨?숇굙已??\\n  // ?洹숆데?洹읙욇펶?녿퉻?類쏄괏??ｊ굄??る짂???퉻?類쏄괏?類쏄콨俑앸씤???痢??쇨쾽鶯낅짅嫄??고렩畑댁떓? 塋???ｊ맙??沅??\\n  // 俑앸씤??塋?鼇?堉?湲깃굘????寃??껎렫????녾쿀??ｊ쾹 Rebar ?????⑦뇡????嫄???샍??됯쾼?袁좉쿁????\\n  // 鼇?堉??沅?誘???琉삳렠癲ル뿣嫄ｉ툣戮⑷깻??沅????袁ｋ짂???퉻?類쏄쾸?琉듦괍??ｊ쾷??ｊ께??(ADR-019)??\\n  const groups = new Map<string, CutoffPosition[]>()\\r\\n\\r\\n  for (const row of rows) {\\r\\n    for (const position of cutoffPositions(input, pack, row)) {\\r\\n      const key =\\r\\n        `${position.memberId}|${position.designMm}|${position.drawnMm}|` +\\r\\n        `${position.count}|${position.slotStart}`\\r\\n      const group = groups.get(key)\\r\\n      if (group) group.push(position)\\r\\n      else groups.set(key, [position])\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  return [...groups.values()].map((positions, index): Rebar => {\\r\\n    const [first] = positions\\r\\n    const count