\\n        `庸?怡?猷붽괵 塋?${basis} 塋?力녹늸??${spliceLengthTerm} 塋?${length} 塋?` +\\r\\n        `??鍮?塋?1????洹숆굴??${first.count}塋딅뛽堉???沃ㅳ렞寃쀥죰?源??〓쫷勇?寃쀨뿥???` +\\r\\n        `?怨덈눉癲⑤씤痢?酉명떖 2塋딅뜉?녺쳥?れ쪎1)??ｊ퉱?猿곴묏癲ル뿣?怨κ퉿??덇맒??⑤듊??留먲┼?Ｂ怨?쭜畑밸（異?┼?κ쿂庸?怡??붿럱` +\\r\\n        `??ｊ턄??Ｂ?껎렫 ??${positions.length}??? 塋?${count} 塋?` +\\r\\n        `??몄돭?酉명떖 塋??議얜옩???괍??곌덮??κ괵 ${fabricationCoverMm} 塋?` +\\r\\n        `3D 鶯ㅒ?뱚 塋??源곸뵄??ｊ덩??산깻?議쇨괩?誘ㅻ짂?瑜낇렩畑댁떓???由??꿸괏櫻?寃??밸묫??산데??寃?琉듦괍??Β? +\\r\\n        `庸?怡?猷붽괵??ｊ굵?臾딆툧?款嫄??ｊ틫?琉듦괍??ｊ데?猷붽괵 ${first.drawnMm} ??鍮?琉듦쾽??逾?袁좉쾼?袁ы렫`,\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction generateStirrup(\\r\\n  member: Member,\\r\\n  span: GirderSpan,\\r\\n  section: GirderSection,\\r\\n  coverRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  fabricationCoverAdditionRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  fabricationCoverMm: number,\\r\\n  hoopLengthAdditionRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  distributionAdditionRule: RuleHit,\\r\\n  hook135Rule: RuleHit,\\r\\n): Rebar {\\r\\n  // 沃ㅻㅈ???揶쏅?????용뮉 獄쏄퀣?귛첎誘れ뵠???????딂쯁?沃ㅳ룂????낆젾??域밸챶?嚥?????(ADR-012)\\r\\n  const startOffsetMm = section.stirrup.startOffsetMm\\r\\n  const stirrupWidthMm = section.b - 2 * fabricationCoverMm\\r\\n  const stirrupDepthMm = section.depth - 2 * fabricationCoverMm\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (stirrupWidthMm <= 0 || stirrupDepthMm <= 0) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '?롫ł?↑쯁?룸땱櫻?,\\r\\n      `?洹숆쿃??ъ땠 ?議얜옩?롫ł??must be positive: ${member.id} ` +\\r\\n        `(${section.b}??{section.depth} ??2??議얜옩???괍??곌덮 ${fabricationCoverMm})`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (span.clear <= 2 * startOffsetMm) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '?롫ł?↑쯁?룸땱櫻?,\\r\\n      `?洹숆쿃??ъ땠 ??몄돭?釉낅펻 must be positive: ${member.id} ` +\\r\\n        `(??얩?${span.clear} ??2????맾??껉묄??좉맙??${startOffsetMm})`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const layout = stirrupPositions(\\r\\n    span.clear,\\r\\n    section.stirrup.pitch,\\r\\n    startOffsetMm,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  // ?怨덈눉??李됧떳?μ쓢濚?1??㏓렣2) ???????횧庸뉖뛼?癲딅틳寃??援???퉻?怨κ묄?猿곴텥??怡ヨ쯁?쎄괼??껉콢??\\n  //